@* @using Radzen
@using Radzen.Blazor *@

@*
  Default-deny: every routable page in this app requires an authenticated
  user unless it explicitly opts out with [AllowAnonymous]. AuthorizeRouteView
  in Routes.razor reads all [Authorize] attributes attached to the routable
  component and enforces them, so this single line covers every page in
  every folder by default. The Auth/Account/Pages/_Imports.razor (login,
  register, forgot/reset password) and a couple of one-off pages
  (NotFoundPage, AccessDenied) override with [AllowAnonymous]; stricter
  role attributes on admin pages stack on top of this base rule.
*@
@attribute [Authorize]
